#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/3node/overview.rst:2
msgid "3-Node HA Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/3node/overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"Current 3-Node HA appliances use three application nodes with RabbitMQ "
"and Elasticsearch services clustered across those nodes. The "
"Transactional Database Tier remains outside the application nodes; all "
"three application nodes use the same external MySQL cluster or supported "
"MySQL service. Do not convert this topology to co-located MySQL as part "
"of an upgrade."
msgstr ""

